# CQ4: Which tasks are still open or blocked, and what is the next step?
PREFIX mem: <https://w3id.org/ompm/mem#>
SELECT ?task ?statement ?status ?next WHERE {
  ?task a mem:TaskState ; mem:statement ?statement ; mem:taskStatus ?status .
  OPTIONAL { ?task mem:nextStep ?next }
  FILTER (?status IN (mem:Open, mem:InProgress, mem:Blocked))
  FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?newer mem:supersedes ?task }
}
